    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start the process, begin by selecting a filter and then applying it."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "After applying the filter, click on the Submit button."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "Next, check if the option to submit is set to \"false\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If it is, then apply another filter."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the option to submit is set to \"true\", then continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Additionally, check if there is another filter to apply."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "If there is, continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "If not, continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Finally, if the option to submit is set to \"true\", continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "The process ends when all steps have been completed."
    }
